  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Irish Aid to WFP Gaza for 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary flexible contribution to WFP will support its objectives in line with the Palestine Emergency Appeal for its response in Gaza. WFP aims to target 1.1 million of those most in need of assistance in Gaza. This will include activities in support of general food assistance (food distrbutions, hot meals programmes), food security (support to bakeries), nutrition, and logistics support.</narrative>
  </description>
